argument is A
comment is //

// One variable for the whole program: this file, its lines and its defs use it; another
// file gets it with `use NAME from FILE`. The rest of the line runs as usual.
// Example: shared visits is 0
//          → visits is 0
modifier shared
    applies to name
    does
        here = self["file"]
        self["files"][here]["names"][TARGET] = (here, TARGET)
